{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-02", "prepared_on": "2026-10-02", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-02</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Google releases Gemini 4 Argon, its most powerful model yet<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 發表 Gemini 4 Argon，稱為迄今最強模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google released its latest Gemini model, marketed as a workhorse for coding and cybersecurity work. Output limit rises to 1 million tokens, but access is initially limited to trusted security defenders.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 推出新一代 Gemini 4 Argon，主打程式開發與資安工作，輸出上限提高到 100 萬個 Token。目前先開放給受信任的資安防禦人員測試，之後才會逐步擴大。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179337\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI's new agent Dots takes a shot at Meta's Muse<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 新代理 Dots 直攻 Meta 的 Muse</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">At DevDay, OpenAI announced Dots, an AI agent powered by GPT-6 Astra, aimed at rivals led by Meta's Muse platform. The question is whether it can compete with a free offering.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 在 DevDay 發表由 GPT-6 Astra 驅動的 AI 代理 Dots，對手主要是 Meta 的 Muse。關鍵在於它能否對抗免費的競品。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1003399/meta-openai-ai-agents-muse-dots-battle\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> California bans AI from deciding on its own to fire employees<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">加州禁止 AI 自行決定解僱員工，成全美首例</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Governor Gavin Newsom signed SB 947, barring employers from relying solely on AI or automated systems for discipline or termination. Such decisions must involve human review.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">加州州長 Newsom 簽署 SB 947，禁止雇主完全依賴 AI 或自動化系統決定懲戒或解僱，重大人事決策必須有人類審查。這是全美首例。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179367\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Judge dismisses antitrust lawsuits over Google's AI Overviews<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">法官駁回針對 Google AI 摘要的反壟斷訴訟</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A federal judge dismissed antitrust suits by Chegg and Penske Media, which accused Google of driving away web traffic with AI search features. Judge Amit Mehta sided with Google.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">聯邦法官駁回 Chegg 與 Penske Media 的反壟斷訴訟，兩家指控 Google 的 AI 搜尋功能搶走網站流量。法官 Amit Mehta 站在 Google 這一邊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1003589/google-ai-overviews-chegg-penske-lawsuits-dismissed\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> OpenAI cuts ties with 3 safety researchers, WSJ reports<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">華爾街日報：OpenAI 與 3 名安全研究員終止合作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI parted ways with three safety researchers after an internal investigation found they mishandled sensitive company information, according to the report.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">報導指出，OpenAI 內部調查發現 3 名安全研究員不當處理公司敏感資訊，因此終止與他們的合作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/01/openai-cuts-ties-with-three-safety-researchers-wsj-reports/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Reddit ends RSS feeds and public API access to curb AI scraping<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Reddit 封堵大規模資料爬取，11 月關 RSS、明年停止公開 API</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Reddit will stop supporting RSS on November 13 and gradually close public API access, ending it fully in March 2027, to reduce large-scale scraping and automated abuse.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Reddit 將在 11 月 13 日停止支援 RSS，並逐步關閉公開 API，2027 年 3 月全面停止，以減少大規模爬取與自動化濫用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179341\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Mandiant: software supply chain attacks expand to CI/CD<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">軟體供應鏈攻擊擴大至 CI/CD，企業需防建置流程遭操弄</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Mandiant says attackers now target trusted security scanners, shared libraries, AI coding tools, developer workstations and CI/CD infrastructure, not just poisoned open-source packages.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Mandiant 指出，攻擊者除了污染開源套件，也鎖定企業信任的安全掃描工具、公用函式庫、AI 開發工具，以及開發人員工作站與 CI/CD 基礎架構。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179322\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> GTIG: exploited vulnerabilities in first 8 months of 2026 exceed all of 2025<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">今年前 8 月遭利用漏洞數超越 2025 全年</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's threat intelligence team reports that both disclosed and exploited vulnerabilities rose sharply in 2026. AI is starting to help find flaws and weaponize known ones faster.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 威脅情報團隊 GTIG 指出，2026 年被揭露與被實際利用的漏洞都明顯增加。AI 已開始協助找漏洞，也讓攻擊者更快利用已知漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179326\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> ChatGPT can now virtually try on clothes for you<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">ChatGPT 現在可以虛擬試穿衣服</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI is rolling out shopping features that let users virtually try on clothing and accessories using their own photos, and save liked products to a Favorites library.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 推出新的購物功能，用戶可用自己的照片虛擬試穿服飾與配件，並把喜歡的商品存進「我的最愛」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/01/chatgpt-can-now-virtually-try-on-clothes-for-you/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Cloudflare rebuilds Containers for AI agent sandboxes<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cloudflare 重構 Containers 支援 AI 代理沙箱，百沙箱並行啟動不需 1 秒</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cloudflare's rebuilt Containers let AI agents spin up isolated Linux environments per task and keep file state after work ends. Median startup for 100 concurrent sandboxes fell from about 4 seconds to 648 ms.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Cloudflare 重構 Containers，讓 AI 代理依任務臨時建立隔離的 Linux 環境，並在結束後保存檔案狀態。同時啟動 100 個沙箱的中位數時間由約 4 秒降到 648 毫秒。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179339\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}